              "title": "Serre",
              "url": "https://www.college-de-france.fr/media/jean-pierre-serre/UPL1698785858825941763_Serre_GAGA.pdf",
              "locator": "\u00a76 Proposition3/Corollary1 printed pp.9\u201311; Annex Propositions22\u201323,27\u201329 printed pp.36\u201340; read."
            }
          ]
        },
        "proof_contract_plan": {
          "state": "unproved proposal; no local proof/native approval",
          "obligations": [
            "Identify finite jets on polynomial local and convergent rings by truncation and finite degree-k monomial grouping of convergent tails",
            "Apply existing completion flatness: T is flat over A and faithfully flat over B",
            "For each injection of A-modules tensor its B-kernel with T, use A-flatness of T and faithful reflection to get zero kernel",
            "Prove local faithfulness and unit injection, then Tor gives B/A flat",
            "Pass to the same extended defining ideal for finite-type quotients; do not invoke reduced-set Nullstellensatz."
          ],
          "source_reading_is_not_proof": true,
