        "statement": "Assume AC. For 0\u2264r\u22643 and any coherent analytic O_{P^r(C)}-module F, every H^q(P^r(C),F), q\u22650, is finite-dimensional. With the locally defined coherent-section Fr\u00e9chet topology and the induced \u010cech quotient topology these cohomology groups are Hausdorff. The proof includes the required Fr\u00e9chet open-mapping and Schwartz compact-complex finiteness results, local coherent-section topology, and compactness of restriction; none is presumed to follow from a Banach-only or one-variable theorem.",
